# Tool routing across MCP servers

Three servers exist with some overlapping tools. Use this guide to pick the right one.

## File search

| Tool | Server | Best for |
|------|--------|----------|
| `ide_find_file` | Index | camelCase/wildcard matching, pagination, library search |
| `find_files_by_name_keyword` | GeneralIDE | simple substring match by name, fastest |
| `find_files_by_glob` | GeneralIDE | glob patterns on full paths |

## Text search

| Tool | Server | Best for |
|------|--------|----------|
| `ide_search_text` | Index | exact word via pre-built word index, filter by code/comments/strings |
| `search_in_files_by_text` | GeneralIDE | substring search with directory/fileMask scope |
| `search_in_files_by_regex` | GeneralIDE | regex patterns |

## Rename

| Tool | Server | Best for |
|------|--------|----------|
| `ide_refactor_rename` | Index | position-based (file+line+column), fine-grained override/related strategies, file rename |
| `rename_refactoring` | GeneralIDE | name-based (symbolName), simpler when position is unknown |

## Run configuration

| Tool | Server | Best for |
|------|--------|----------|
| `get_run_configurations` | GeneralIDE | list configs with command line, env vars, working dir details |
| `list_run_configurations` | Debugger | list configs (lighter, same names) |
| `execute_run_configuration` | GeneralIDE | run and capture output |
| `start_debug_session` | Debugger | run with breakpoints and stepping |

## Diagnostics

| Tool | Server | Best for |
|------|--------|----------|
| `get_file_problems` | GeneralIDE | single-file inspection (errors + warnings) |
| `ide_diagnostics` | Index | combined file analysis + build errors + test results, quick-fix intentions |
| `build_project` | GeneralIDE | full or partial compilation with error output |
